4_00003":"","msg_0572_T24_00004":"Teach Fly to your Pokémon.\\rYou will be able to Fly instantly\\nto anywhere you have visited.","msg_0572_T24_00005":"My husband lost to you, so he needs\\nto train harder.\\rThat’s good, since he was getting a\\nlittle chubby.","msg_0572_T24_00006":"Your Bag is full.","msg_0572_T24_00007":"His only hobby is to battle\\ntough Trainers.\\rDo you want to have my\\nhusband’s phone number? {YESNO 0}","msg_0572_T24_00008":"{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} registered Chuck\\nin the Pokégear!","msg_0572_T24_00009":"He takes a break from the pounding\\nwaterfall on Wednesday nights.\\rHe should be able to chat with\\nyou then.","msg_0572_T24_00010":"Oh, I see.\\nMy husband won’t be a good match?","msg_0572_T24_00011":"Do you want to exchange your\\nnumber for my husband’s? {YESNO 0}","msg_0572_T24_00012":"If you use Fly, you can get back\\nto Olivine instantly.","msg_0572_T24_00013":"Boulders to the north of town can\\nbe crushed.\\rThey may be hiding something.\\nYour Pokémon could use Rock Smash to\\fbreak them.","msg_0572_T24_00014":"Chuck, the Gym Leader, spars with\\nhis Fighting-type Pokémon.","msg_0572_T24_00015":"Eusine: Yo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\\rWasn’t that SUICUNE just now?\\rI only caught a quick glimpse, but I\\nthought I saw SUICUNE running on\\fthe waves.\\rSUICUNE is beautiful and grand.\\nAnd it races through towns and\\froads at simply awesome speeds.\\rIt’s wonderful...\\rI want to see SUICUNE up close...\\rI’ve decided.\\nI’ll battle you as a Trainer to earn\\fSUICUNE’s respect!\\rCome on, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\\nLet’s battle now!","msg_0572_T24_00016":"You’re amazing, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\\rI’m starting to understand why SUICUNE\\nwas keeping an eye on you.\\rI’m going to keep searching\\nfor SUICUNE.\\rI have a feeling we’ll see each other\\nagain. See you around!\\r","msg_0572_T24_00017":"There are several islands between\\nhere and Olivine.\\rA mythical sea creature supposedly\\nlives there.","msg_0572_T24_00018":"Cianwood City\\nA Port of Crashing Waves","msg_0572_T24_00019":"Cianwood City Pokémon Gym\\nLeader: Chuck\\fHis Roaring Fists Do the Talking","msg_0572_T24_00020":"Cianwood City Pharmacy\\r500 Years of Tradition\\nWe Await Your Medicinal Queries","msg_0572_T24_00021":"This is the house of Cameron,\\nthe Photographer.\\fTake a Snapshot as a Keepsake!","msg_0572_T24_00022":"Entrance to the road for the\\nSafari Zone.\\rExperience thrilling encounters\\nwith wild Pokémon for heart-to-heart\\fcontact!\\rThe Safari Zone is just around the\\ncorner from this entrance!"},"initTriggers":[{"var":"VAR_UNK_4116","value":1,"script":"_EV_scr_seq_T24_006 + 1"}],"initScripts":{"OnTransition":"_EV_scr_seq_T24_005 + 1"},"constants":{"_EV_scr_seq_T24_000":0,"_EV_scr_seq_T24_001":1,"_EV_scr_seq_T24_002":2,"_EV_scr_seq_T24_003":3,"_EV_scr_seq_T24_004":4,"_EV_scr_seq_T24_005":5,"_EV_scr_seq_T24_006":6,"_EV_scr_seq_T24_007":7,"_EV_scr_seq_T24_008":8,"_EV_scr_seq_T24_009":9,"_EV_scr_seq_T24_010":10,"_EV_scr_seq_T24_011":11,"_EV_scr_seq_T24_012":12,"_EV_scr_seq_T24_013":13,"_EV_scr_seq_T24_014":14,"_EV_scr_seq_T24_015":15,"obj_T24_middlewoman1_2":0,"obj_T24_gsboy1":1,"obj_T24_gsmiddleman1":2,"obj_T24_gsgirl1":3,"obj_T24_middlewoman1_2_2":4,"obj_T24_tsure_poke_static_suicune":5,"obj_T24_minaki":6,"obj_T24_breakrock":7,"obj_T24_breakrock_2":8,"obj_T24_breakrock_3":9,"obj_T24_breakrock_4":10,"obj_T24_breakrock_5":11}}
